    "description": "상세요강\n모집부문\n구분\n상세내용\nSales Manager\n[강남]\nResponsibilities\nㆍDevelop and execute a sales strategy for IT/AI/software application products within\nthe data center ecosystem.\nㆍIdentify, prospect, and qualify new business opportunities.\n(enterprises, cloud/data center customers, system integrators, and relevant partners)\nㆍManage the full sales cycle, including discovery, solution mapping,\nproposal development, negotiation, and closing.\nㆍBuild and maintain strong relationships with customers, key stakeholders,\nand partners.\nㆍCoordinate with internal teams(engineering, product, marketing, delivery) to ensure\nsolutions are properly scoped and delivered.\nㆍPrepare and present sales materials, product demonstrations, and technical/business\nproposals.\nㆍMaintain accurate sales forecasts, pipeline reporting, and customer activity tracking.\nㆍMonitor market trends in AI adoption, enterprise software, and data center IT\nrequirements and provide insights for product and go-to-market improvements.\nㆍParticipate in industry events and contribute to partner/channel development.\nQualifications and Experience\nㆍBachelor’s degree in Information Technology, Computer Science, Engineering, or\nrelated field. (or equivalent experience)\nㆍProven experience in enterprise sales, preferably involving IT solutions, software\napplications, or AI-related offerings.\nㆍStrong understanding of how AI/IT Services and how they map to data center\nenvironments. (at a high level)\nㆍAbility to handle consultative selling and communicate value propositions effectively\nto both business and technical stakeholders.\nㆍStrong pipeline management and commercial negotiation skills.\nㆍProficiency in spoken and written English is required.\nCost Engineer\n(Assistant\nQuantity\nSurveyor)\n[부산]\nResponsibilities\nㆍAssist in handling contractual and commercial matters of multi-discipline projects\nand tenders.\nㆍPerform periodic review on progress of projects, give advice on potential delays\nand highlight risk factors.\nㆍLiaise with external and internal parties on contractual matters.\nㆍAssist for pre & post contract stages quantity surveying duties.\nㆍHandle tender analysis and bidding, tender document administration,\nmeasurement of works, valuation of variation & etc.\nㆍAssist for cost estimation, subletting, certifying payment, variation and settlement of\nfinal account.\nQualifications and Experience\nㆍHigher Diploma or above in Quantity Surveying or related disciplines.\nㆍMinimum 2~3 years’ relevant working experience is highly preferred.\nㆍProactive, well-organized and able to work independently.\nㆍProficient in PC applications. (e.g. MS Excel, Words etc.)\nㆍGood command of written and spoken English.\nㆍCandidates with more experience will be considered Quantity Surveyor.\nNetwork\nEngineer\n[부산]\nResponsibilities\nㆍManage and maintain the network infrastructure.\n(Routers, Switches, Firewalls, Load Balancers)\nㆍImplement and refine monitoring solutions to identify and resolve bottlenecks\nbefore they impact the business.\nㆍLead Level 2/3 troubleshooting for complex network outages, conducting thorough\nroot cause analysis to prevent recurrence.\nㆍReview and execute critical network changes, ensuring all updates follow ITIL\nstandards to minimize operational risk.\nㆍManage firewall policies, VPN access, and firmware patching cycles to maintain\na hardened security posture.\nㆍCoordinate with ISPs and hardware vendors to ensure service level agreements are\nmet, and equipment life cycles are managed.\nㆍMaintain network diagrams, SOPs, and inventory records.\nQualifications and Experience\nㆍBachelor’s degree in computer science, Computer Engineering,\nInformation Engineering, or equivalent.\nㆍ3-5 years of experience in IT networking.\nㆍKnowledge of Routing and Switching, firewall technology, network security principles,\nand network monitoring.\nㆍCCNP certification holder or equivalent is preferred.\nㆍHands-on experience with High-Performance Computing(HPC) networks,\nLow-Latency fabrics, or InfiniBand is a significant advantage.\nㆍFluent in English. (both written and spoken)\n전형절차\n※ 전형절차 및 일정은 당사 사정에 따라 변경될 수 있습니다.\n(The selection process and schedule may be subject to change at the company's discretion.)\n※ 모집분야 별로 필요 시 영어 인터뷰가 진행됩니다.\n(An English interview will be conducted if necessary, depending on the recruitment category.)\n제출서류\nㆍ영문/국문 이력서, 자기소개서\n※ 모든 제출서류는 PDF 또는 MS WORD 파일로 제출 바랍니다.\n※ 이력서 및 관련 제출 서류는 국문과 영문을 모두 반드시 제출해 주시기 바랍니다.\n(Applicants are required to submit their resume and relevant documents in both Korean and English.)\n※ 영문 이력서가 제출되지 않으면 서류 검토가 진행되지 않을 수도 있습니다.\n(Please note that if an English resume is not submitted, the document review process may not proceed.)\n접수기간 및 방법\nㆍ접수기간 :\n2026년 09월 13일까지\nㆍ접수방법 :\n국/영문 이력서, 자기소개서 기재하여 사람인 온라인 입사지원\n기타사항\nㆍ서류전형 합격자에 한하여 개별 연락 드립니다.\nㆍ입사지원서 기재 내용의 착오 또는 누락으로 인하여 발생한 불이익은 본인에게 책임이 있으며,\n허위사실 기재 및 허위증빙서 제출 시 채용확정 이후라고 채용이 취소될 수 있습니다.\nㆍ모집부문 간 중복지원(원아시아코리아의 모든 채용 내)은 불가하며, 중복지원 시 심사대상에서 제외될 수 있음을\n유의하시기 바랍니다.",
