    "company": "(주)클로닉스",
    "title": "Technical Support Engineer (Field Engineer)",
    "description": "상세요강\nTechnical Support Engineer\n(Field Engineer)\n모집분야\nTechnical Support Engineer\nCLONIX, founded in 2004, is a specialized software company that develops proprietary backup, security, and data erasure solutions. Based on its in-house disk imaging technology, CLONIX develops and supplies a broad range of solutions, including WinClon, a system backup and recovery solution; DiskClon, a hard drive duplication and erasure solution; as well as digital forensics and permanent data erasure solutions.\nCLONIX has earned recognition for its technological expertise by providing solutions to major domestic and international enterprises and global storage device manufacturers. With a strong focus on user-friendly product design, the company delivers integrated solutions covering the entire lifecycle, from system implementation to maintenance, that can be easily used even by non-technical users.\nBuilding on more than 20 years of accumulated technical expertise and business experience, CLONIX is currently expanding into the development of solutions and kiosks designed specifically for integrated casino resorts. We are looking for a Technical Support Engineer to join us in creating and delivering new services.\n📋\nKey Responsibilities\nㆍProvide technical support for kiosks and other company hardware/equipment, including newly launched and existing products\nㆍRespond to on-site incidents and technical issues\nㆍSupport integration issues between hardware and software\nㆍSupport on-site installation, maintenance, and operations\n📋\nRequirements\nㆍ3+ years of experience in technical support, field engineering, or maintenance\nㆍUnderstanding of hardware/software integrated environments\nㆍExperience operating and troubleshooting Windows-based systems\nㆍBasic knowledge of networking/IP, Serial, and USB devices\nㆍNo restrictions on overseas business travel\nㆍBusiness-level English communication skills\n📋\nPreferred Qualifications\n(If you meet any of the following, we encourage you to apply!)\nㆍMaintenance experience with kiosks, POS, ATM, or industrial equipment\nㆍExperience integrating hardware or external devices\nㆍExperience in remote support or customer-facing technical support\nㆍExperience with Windows Embedded or service environments\nㆍExperience using issue tracking systems such as Jira\nㆍBasic Korean communication skills are a plus\n📋\nVisa Requirement\nㆍ\nPlease note: We are unable to provide visa sponsorship for this position. Applicants must already hold a valid visa that permits employment in Korea (e.g., F-2, F-4, F-5, F-6, D-10, etc.).\n🏠 Working Conditions\n• Employment Type :Permanent Position (3-month probationary period)\n• Salary: To be determined after the interview\n• Work Location: 91, LS-ro 116beon-gil, Dongan-gu, Anyang-si, Gyeonggi-do, Republic of Korea\n• 근무일수/시간 :\n🚀 Recruitment Process\nApplication Period:\n2026-09-02 17시 ~ 2026-10-02 24시\nRequired Documents: Saramin online resume\nHow to Apply: Apply through Saramin\nSelection Process: Document Screening → Technical Interview → Executive Interview → Final Offer\n🛎️ Notice\n• If any false information is found in the application documents, the offer may be withdrawn even after the hiring decision has been made.",
