    "title": "SoC/System Architect",
    "description": "상세요강\nSoC/System Architect\n서비스 소개\nAbout SEMIFIVE\r\n\r\nFounded in Seoul in 2019, SEMIFIVE is basing its foundation on Korea’s semiconductor design competency that was amassed for more than 20 years. With expertise in front-end to back-end design, SEMIFIVE has become the fastest-growing silicon design company that offers the most comprehensive design solutions. SEMIFIVE’s core business is its innovative Platform SoC that enables low-cost & high-efficiency SoC design, and also provides various design solutions for global customers through its diverse network. As the cost of developing an SoC and the demand for customized silicon continue to grow rapidly, SEMIFIVE’s Platform SoC will play a key role in turning innovative ideas into silicon.\r\n\r\nSEMIFIVE, hand in hand with global innovation leaders, is growing as a leading partner for future SoC designs, and thereby becoming: The New Global Hub of Custom Silicon.\n이\r\n                        포지션의\nAI 예상 면접 질문\n이\r\n                        궁금하다면 점핏에서 확인해보세요!\n모집부문 / 상세내용\n사용 기술\nGit\nPerl\nPython\nHW\nShell\n주요업무\nJob Purpose\r\n\r\nWe are looking for a highly skilled SoC/System Architect who will lead architecture definition and technical feasibility analysis for HPC/AI/Vision/Multi-media/Automotive/etc. SoC. The role focuses on early-stage customer requirement analysis, system-level design feasibility analysis, and architectural optimization to achieve best-in-class performance, power, and area (PPA).\r\n\r\n\r\nPrincipal Accountabilities\r\n\r\nㆍTechnical Feasibility & Early-Stage Architecture Review\r\n  -Lead technical reviews in the feasibility/RFQ phase to assess SoC viability.\r\n  -Analyze customer requirements and convert them into system-level architectural concepts.\r\n  -Build optimization strategies based on performance, efficiency, and integration potential.\r\nㆍSoC/System Architecture Definition\r\n  -Define and review architecture across compute, memory, interconnect, multimedia, and interface subsystems.\r\n  -Identify missing IPs, subsystem bottlenecks, and HW/SW interface inefficiencies.\r\n  -Drive architectural improvements and system partitioning to meet PPA targets.\r\nㆍPerformance, Power, and Area (PPA) Optimization\r\n  -Conduct stage-by-stage PPA analysis across design phases.\r\n  -Derive practical optimization directions for architecture, logic design, and floorplanning teams.\r\n  -Collaborate with implementation engineers to realize architecture intent in physical design.\r\nㆍCross-Team Technical Collaboration\r\n  -Communicate architectural feedback to customer and internal design teams.\r\nㆍContribute to design methodology and roadmap\r\n\r\n-Key Performance Measures\r\nㆍStrong ownership and system-level thinking.\r\nㆍAbility to identify bottlenecks and propose architecture-driven solutions.\r\nㆍCollaborative mindset with clear technical communication and leadership.\n자격요건\nㆍBS/MS in Electrical Engineering, Computer Engineering, or related field.\r\nㆍ7+ years of experience in SoC or System Architecture design for HPC, AI, mobile, vision, or automotive platforms.\r\nㆍExpertise in SoC-level PPA trade-off analysis.\r\nㆍStrong understanding of subsystem design (CPU, GPU, ISP, NPU, interconnect, memory hierarchy).\r\nㆍProven experience in cross-functional collaboration and architecture documentation.\n우대사항\nㆍFamiliarity with low-power design methodologies and advanced process technologies.\r\nㆍKnowledge of simulation/emulation platforms for architecture validation.\r\nㆍBackground in system modeling or co-design with embedded software.\n마감일 및 근무지\n• 마감일 : 2026년 09월 29일\n• 근무지\n- 경기 성남시 분당구 양현로 322, 6층 603호, 605호\n복지 및 혜택\nㆍ종합건강검진\r\nㆍ유급병가지원\r\nㆍ단체상해보험지원\r\nㆍ경조사지원\r\nㆍ명절선물\r\nㆍ생일선물\r\nㆍ중식제공\r\nㆍ사내스낵바무한운영\r\nㆍ도서구매지원\r\nㆍ사내도서관\r\nㆍ유연근무제\r\nㆍ주차지원\n채용절차 및 기타 지원 유의사항\nㆍ서류전형  팀별면접  임원면접  최종합격\r\nㆍ면접일정은 추후 통보됩니다.\r\n\r\n-접수된 서류는 채용과 무관한 곳에는 사용하지 않습니다.\r\n-‘채용절차법’에 의거하여 반환 청구 기간 내 채용서류의 반환을 청구할 수 있습니다.\r\n• 반환 서류 : 채용과정에서 제출한 서류 (*온라인으로 제출한 채용 서류 제외)\r\n• 반환 청구 기간 : 결과 통지일 (채용여부가 확정된 날)로부터 180일 이내\r\n• 반환 청구 신청 : careers@semifive.com 반환 청구 메일 신청\r\n• 서류 반환 절차 : 신청 확인된 날로부터 14일 이내 지정한 주소지로 등기우편 발송\r\n-지원 접수일로부터 반환 청구기간이 지난 서류는 별도의 파기 신청이 없더라도 ‘개인정보보호법’에 의거하여 지체 없이 채용 서류 일체를 파기할 예정입니다.",
